# Settings for the Bluetooth A2DP receiver.
# Installed to /etc/default/bt-receiver.
#
# Both may stay empty: bt-receiver then reads the output card and the hardware
# mixer from Volumio's own settings, so switching DAC in Volumio is enough.
# Fill them in only to send Bluetooth audio somewhere other than Volumio's
# current output.
#
# CARD  - ALSA card name, as shown by:  aplay -l
# MIXER - hardware mixer element, as shown by:  amixer -c <CARD> scontrols
#         leave empty to let the phone control volume itself

CARD=
MIXER=
